      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحنّب</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
crooked, curved,</i> or <i>bent.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And hence,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحنّب عَلَيْهِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, affected with
compassion for him.</i> (K, TA.)

